{"duration": 267.0509375, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.04, "text": "A two-day trip to Gokarna. One way by road, nine and a half hours. Round trip, 19.", "words": [[0.0, 0.32, " A"], [0.32, 0.58, " two"], [0.58, 0.72, "-day"], [0.72, 0.96, " trip"], [0.96, 1.18, " to"], [1.18, 2.02, " Gokarna."], [2.24, 2.36, " One"], [2.36, 2.54, " way"], [2.54, 2.82, " by"], [2.82, 3.08, " road,"], [3.46, 3.6, " nine"], [3.6, 3.78, " and"], [3.78, 3.88, " a"], [3.88, 4.04, " half"], [4.04, 4.54, " hours."], [4.94, 5.18, " Round"], [5.18, 5.48, " trip,"], [5.6, 6.04, " 19."]]}, {"start": 6.58, "end": 12.44, "text": "And Mysore. Two and a half hours each way. The same video promises both trips in two days.", "words": [[6.58, 6.8, " And"], [6.8, 7.4, " Mysore."], [7.92, 8.06, " Two"], [8.06, 8.26, " and"], [8.26, 8.32, " a"], [8.32, 8.48, " half"], [8.48, 8.78, " hours"], [8.78, 9.08, " each"], [9.08, 9.36, " way."], [9.8, 9.94, " The"], [9.94, 10.16, " same"], [10.16, 10.62, " video"], [10.62, 11.04, " promises"], [11.04, 11.38, " both"], [11.38, 11.64, " trips"], [11.64, 11.84, " in"], [11.84, 12.06, " two"], [12.06, 12.44, " days."]]}, {"start": 12.9, "end": 16.2, "text": "Six places from one video, about trips out of Bangalore.", "words": [[12.9, 13.16, " Six"], [13.16, 13.56, " places"], [13.56, 13.8, " from"], [13.8, 14.0, " one"], [14.0, 14.42, " video,"], [14.76, 14.98, " about"], [14.98, 15.3, " trips"], [15.3, 15.48, " out"], [15.48, 15.64, " of"], [15.64, 16.2, " Bangalore."]]}, {"start": 16.54, "end": 21.2, "text": "On screen, the author gives kilometers. I count the hours in the car, both ways.", "words": [[16.54, 16.78, " On"], [16.78, 17.14, " screen,"], [17.4, 17.54, " the"], [17.54, 17.76, " author"], [17.76, 18.04, " gives"], [18.04, 18.66, " kilometers."], [19.18, 19.36, " I"], [19.36, 19.5, " count"], [19.5, 19.74, " the"], [19.74, 19.86, " hours"], [19.86, 20.02, " in"], [20.02, 20.2, " the"], [20.2, 20.44, " car,"], [20.54, 20.78, " both"], [20.78, 21.2, 