: "pylons. In the video's frame, there was only tea and mountains. And this is the boat dock on", "words": [[142.52, 143.02, " pylons."], [143.4, 143.54, " In"], [143.54, 143.68, " the"], [143.68, 144.14, " video's"], [144.14, 144.38, " frame,"], [144.58, 144.68, " there"], [144.68, 144.84, " was"], [144.84, 145.16, " only"], [145.16, 145.42, " tea"], [145.42, 145.66, " and"], [145.66, 146.16, " mountains."], [146.58, 146.74, " And"], [146.74, 147.0, " this"], [147.0, 147.18, " is"], [147.18, 147.36, " the"], [147.36, 147.6, " boat"], [147.6, 147.8, " dock"], [147.8, 148.0, " on"]]}, {"start": 148.0, "end": 153.38, "text": "the lake. The author himself warns the town may feel too commercial. The Nilgiri Mountain", "words": [[148.0, 148.12, " the"], [148.12, 148.38, " lake."], [148.88, 149.0, " The"], [149.0, 149.22, " author"], [149.22, 149.7, " himself"], [149.7, 150.06, " warns"], [150.06, 150.28, " the"], [150.28, 150.52, " town"], [150.52, 150.94, " may"], [150.94, 151.18, " feel"], [151.18, 151.4, " too"], [151.4, 151.86, " commercial."], [152.34, 152.46, " The"], [152.46, 153.0, " Nilgiri"], [153.0, 153.38, " Mountain"]]}, {"start": 153.38, "end": 160.52, "text": "Railway is a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Uti sits at 2,240 meters. From Bangalore,", "words": [[153.38, 153.92, " Railway"], [153.92, 154.36, " is"], [154.36, 154.5, " a"], [154.5, 154.88, " UNESCO"], [154.88, 155.28, " World"], [155.28, 155.62, " Heritage"], [155.62, 156.04, " Site."], [156.42, 156.74, " Uti"], [156.74, 156.96, " sits"], [156.96, 157.22, " at"], [157.22, 157.86, " 2"], [157.86, 158.62, ",240"], [158.62, 159.14, " meters."], [159.52, 159.78, " From"], [159.78, 160.52, " Bangalore,"]]}, {"start": 160.52, "end": 167.04, "text": "about 270 kilometers and six and a half hours. Round trip, 13 hours. Verdict,", "words": [[160.52, 161.14, " about"], [161.14, 161.98, " 270"], [161.98, 162.66, " kilometers"], [162.66, 163.0, " and"], [163.0, 163.24, " six"], [163.24, 163.4, " and"], [163.4, 1